{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Hero Hellspawn \u2013 Roguelite English Learning Game\u00a0</strong>(Demo)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on endless challenges to \u2694\ufe0f strengthen your hero! <br>Open \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f treasure chests to strategically optimize your build, <br>and solve \ud83e\udde0 English quizzes to reduce cooldowns and gain buffs to defeat powerful monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f Demo Limitations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only 1 hero can be selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only 3 upgrades are available; further upgrades are not supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(\u203b Full game allows all heroes and full upgrade features.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcda English Learning Points</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 Approximately 20,000 sentences and 30,000 words and idioms included <br>\u2705 Sentence-based learning is more effective for vocabulary acquisition <br>\u2705 Actively speaking and writing (output) enhances memory retention <br>\u2705 Search and learn any word you want to study</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 Included Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily conversations \u2013 tailored for lower and upper elementary levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hobby English \u2013 travel \u2708\ufe0f, soccer \u26bd, fashion \ud83d\udc57, automobiles \ud83d\ude97, fitness \ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Informational English \u2013 Greek and Roman mythology, Excel \ud83e\udde0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spatial expressions \u2013 vocabulary related to the home \ud83c\udfe0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character-focused content \u2013 Lincoln \ud83e\uddd4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game English \u2013 DAVE THE DIVER \ud83c\udfae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 Learn and have fun simultaneously!</strong> <br>En